WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
The Labyrinth of Zeus's Ring

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:37.030
Now then…

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.630
it's time we stopped playing around

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.220
I'll give you a special show of the powers of Zeus in this ring.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.930
The power that Micchi had sealed is…

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.100
Kujyou…

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.490
you don't have the strength to run away anymore.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:10.850
Cooperate with me…

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:15.810
and this time we'll obtain the real power of the gods.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:18.920
Karasuma Kirihiko…

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.950
Anyway, right now…

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:24.610
somehow I have to get Karin out of here safely.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.180
Karin, let's get out of here!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.700
If you think you can escape…

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.250
you're terribly mistaken!

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:47.700
There's no exit.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.600
How's that, Kujyou?

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.350
Why don't you work with me?

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.480
Like we did in the past…

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:58.610
I refuse.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.030
You know that, in truth…

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.660
you really want to research more about god transformations.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.910
What about you?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.300
Still haven't given up on it, huh?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:15.250
Kazune-kun, like we did in the past? 
What's god research?

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.390
What's this other glasses guy saying?

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.550
He said a lot of stuff about you, too…

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.940
it must be some kind of mistake, right?

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.390
What's this, Kujyou?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.700
Did you not tell her anything?

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.740
Kazune-kun… do you know something?

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.210
Why aren't you telling me?

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:47.030
Then I will tell you…

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.490
about me and Kujyou…

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:53.930
and the research we did to get closer to the gods.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.790
Research?

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:59.040
At first, it was just for fun…

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:03.710
but we became more involved in our research…

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:08.860
and then we reached the level of gods and could not turn back.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.720
And then what was born was Kujyou's clone, him-

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.060
Stop it!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:18.390
And the result of the god research experiment, you!

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.060
Experiment?

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.940
What does he mean?

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.650
Kazune-kun, what do you know about me?

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:27.980
Let's run, Karin.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.490
What did he mean, Kazune-kun?

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.750
Explain it to me!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.590
Can't you remember?

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:39.500
About yourself…

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.520
about who you really are.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.560
There's no way you can remember.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:48.760
Why is that?

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:53.280
Because your memory was completely erased by Kujyou!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.930
Kazune-kun, is that true?

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.350
That's not right…

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.850
it was to protect you…

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:01.610
it couldn't be helped.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.400
Now that I think about it…

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:06.940
I don't know anything about my parents…

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:11.030
all that was left behind was my mother's memento…

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:12.820
this ring.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.540
Kazune-kun, you know something, don't you?

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:25.880
Hey, Kazune-kun!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.590
Why are you staying silent?

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.300
Why won't you say anything?

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.310
Kazune-kun!

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:46.820
Both Kazune-chan and Micchi.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.900
I wonder where they went.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.780
Don't worry about it!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:55.800
I'm sure everyone will come home soon!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:03.420
Ah. Kazune-chan's birdie.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.080
Huh?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.260
Where are you going?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.240
Birdie!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:20.850
Wow! Amazing…

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:24.860
I-It turned into a human!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.710
I wonder what species of bird that is.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.990
So that is what's happening.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:34.110
What awful things are happening at Karasuma's house…

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:37.450
Yes. Karin-sama is also there.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.580
However, because Kazune-sama can't transform…

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.660
I don't know if they'll be alright or not.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.540
I see. I understand.

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:48.130
But are you alright, Kazusa?

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.210
Yes, somehow.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.420
What's this all about?

00:06:52.420 --> 00:07:00.280
There's trouble at glasses guy's house, probably.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:09.400
Himeka-chan, what's all that?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:13.740
I'm going to save them!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:14.860
Huh?!

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:19.870
Even though Kazune-chan and the others are in trouble…

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:24.040
I am just sitting around and waiting.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.250
That's no good!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:29.090
It's impossible for you, Himeka-chan!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:36.300
Even I… don't like always having to wait.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.760
And…

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:43.020
I'm always being protected by them.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:47.130
I want to protect them too!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.360
Himeka-chan…

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.980
But it's still no good!

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:54.860
Himeka-chan, there's no way I'm letting you go!

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:56.930
Please!

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:00.120
Get out of the way, Shii-chan!

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.840
I definitely won't move!

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:12.050
- There, there, there!

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:11.630
- N-Nya! When I look at that…

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:14.380
- I can't control myself!

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.050
Darn it!

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:22.560
Himeka-chan, you can't go!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:26.160
It's no good trying to stop me.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.830
Even though this isn't the time to be playing around…

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.290
What's the meaning of this, Kujyou?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.710
You want to quit the research on gods?

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.480
Yeah.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.630
Like I thought, this research is wrong, Karasuma.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.550
We can become gods!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.800
We can obtain the power of the gods!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.550
We can play with the power of the rings as much as we want.

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:06.020
Once we become gods, we can do whatever we want!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:10.270
Doesn't just thinking about it make you excited?

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.900
That's enough already.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.690
The research has lost its meaning.

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:17.110
That's not true!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.910
The power of gods is necessary!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.420
We can change the world!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.830
Sorry, Karasuma…

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.390
I won't give you my data from my research on gods.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:41.970
After that…

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.850
you sealed all the data you had obtained up to that point…

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.270
in Himeka.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.560
Whoever targets them or tries to protect them…

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:55.920
is involved in the god research whether they like it or not.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.860
Kazune-kun isn't saying anything…

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:05.370
but what glasses guy is saying is probably all true.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.950
Things like clones and like research…

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:11.870
It's hard to understand and I don't get all of it, but…

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:14.210
the one thing I know for sure…

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:18.230
Kazune-kun not telling me anything is starting to really tick me off!

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:20.630
Kujyou…

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:22.760
where's your Himeka?

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.800
Are you stupid? What could you do even if you knew?

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:29.770
Then… I will use force to make you tell me.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.690
Prepare yourself.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:32.810
Kujyou.

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:36.570
Karin, at least you should get out of-

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.110
Huh? Karin?

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.650
What?

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.950
I'm really mad right now!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.530
Huh?

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:48.910
Kazune-kun, you knew all about what glasses guy was saying.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.710
You knew and you didn't tell me…

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.350
that's so mean!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.880
The end of your friendship?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.460
I thought we were friends.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:03.070
I thought you trusted me.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:07.050
But you didn't tell me anything about what was really important!

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.560
Karin.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:12.940
To you, is that all I mean to you?!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:13.560
No-

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.520
That's enough already!

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:19.450
Kazune-kun… Kazune-kun…

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.900
I hate you!

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:28.740
Karin!

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:32.770
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:36.310
I am God!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.270
You moron.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.270
It's a croquette!

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:50.740
Is this glasses guy's house?

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.870
I asked Kujyou before…

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:03.920
but it seems like the two Himekas have been brought together.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:18.710
Himeka-chan, what is this?

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.460
It is…

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.810
Who's there?

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.400
You're the one…

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.900
from that time…

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.930
- from the dream. 
- from the dream.

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:37.520
You're Himeka-chan, aren't you?

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.980
Huh? Why do you…

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:43.820
I heard it from Kirio-chan.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.700
That there's another me.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.990
Huh?

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:52.120
You know, my name's also Himeka.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:54.830
Hime…ka?

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.930
We finally meet.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.860
The code that's hidden within you…

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:18.620
I'll steal it with the power of Zeus's ring.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.610
Stop it, Karasuma!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.310
I remember…

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.600
You are…

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.730
the other half…

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.360
of me.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.030
Karin…

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.250
In addition, when I…

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:24.810
tried to steal the god transformation data using Zeus's power.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.400
Himeka was split into two.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:32.890
But… if your rings broke…

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.550
your Himeka would disappear.

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:37.060
If that happened…

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:41.060
our Himeka would become a whole and complete the set of data.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.750
All the god transformation research would become mine.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:49.940
When there is a full moon, the seal of the Gods will dissolve.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.650
The time when Himeka becomes whole…

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:55.220
is when the code of the god transformation research is completed.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.540
The words hidden in Nishikiyori's ring.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.180
So this is what they meant.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.730
Where am I?

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.850
Kazune-kun, where are you?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.810
Let's go, Kujyou.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.020
I'll break your rings…

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:26.190
and finally obtain the completed data.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.730
I won't let you.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.860
No, Kazune-kun!

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:33.200
If you transform, your body won't be able to take it!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.860
Karin…

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.600
What's wrong, Kujyou?

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.120
Even though you're just a clone made to transform…

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:47.230
you can't even transform now?

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.550
Then I won't hold back…

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.940
and I'll attack first!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.440
Kazune-kun!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:13.780
What is that… ring?

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:17.200
It has way more power than any other ring…

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.130
Take this!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.890
Stop it!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.010
Kazune-kun!

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.880
Disappear, Kujyou!

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.340
Nyake!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.520
Nyake.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.060
I gave it my all…

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.480
Are you okay? Why are you here?

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.870
I came with Himeka-chan.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:53.230
Himeka's here?

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:54.740
That's right.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.910
She met up with the other Himeka and they both just disappeared.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.160
What did you say?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:04.910
I'm sorry… that I couldn't protect Himeka-chan.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:06.830
It's alright, I understand.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.540
Take Karin and get out of here.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.380
I'll save Himeka.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.300
Just leave it to me!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:17.020
It's all up to me so I'll do it without a doubt.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:22.550
Oh? Can you still stand?

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:25.600
But you can't transform.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.810
How long will you last?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.690
Like I thought…

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:33.290
fighting with you this way is pointless.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.920
I'll finish it up with this.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.360
Ego sumo deus!

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.390
You finally transformed, Kujyou.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:57.060
Karin-chan, we have to run!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:17:59.760
Kazune-kun!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.640
Karin, you have to run.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.760
I'll defeat him and save Himeka for sure.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:05.720
But…

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.600
Stop fooling around!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:11.080
What can you do, even if you're here.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.980
I told you to just get going and run already.

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.880
Stop dawdling around!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.450
Kazune-kun!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:28.500
Karin… sorry for everything.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.130
Kazune-kun?

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:45.260
Fine. I'll destroy your ring first.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:47.390
I won't let you.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.730
I'm strong, you know.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.900
Kazune-kun…

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.740
You're ill-tempered and mean.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:04.410
But, I eventually understood that you weren't a bad person.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:07.410
Today… was fun.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.220
When I am with you and we're fighting like kids…

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.200
it makes me really…

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:30.600
In reality… who I am or that Kazune-kun is professor Kujyou doesn't matter.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.600
Kazune-kun is Kazune-kun…

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:37.710
and Kazune-kun is important to me.

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:43.340
What can you do, even if you're here.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:50.930
Kazune-chan… I can see through you… it's obvious.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:58.520
I always notice when you lie… because of your habit.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.020
Karin-chan?

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:07.180
Sorry, Shii-chan, I have to go back after all.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.850
Karin-chan!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.100
I finally understand.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.680
Not telling me anything about the important things…

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.440
Not trusting me…

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.650
Who cares about that!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:21.670
I don't want to be separated from Kazune-kun again!

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:30.380
Please, somehow, take me to where Kazune-kun is!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.830
Take this!

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.420
Kazune-kun!

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:46.220
Karin?

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.700
I'm so glad, I found you!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:52.490
Why did you get back, moron?!

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:54.680
But…

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:57.270
Jeez! Always being reckless!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.190
Always making me worry about you!

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.110
You make me mad!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.340
Like I thought, Kazune-kun is Kazune-kun.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.300
I'm sorry, for saying I hate you.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.990
I don't care about the difficult things.

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:16.790
You're important to me.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.500
Knowing that is enough.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.130
Thanks.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.090
So you did come back.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:26.800
Now I can take care of both of you together…

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.180
using the power of all the gods…

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.720
which Zeus's ring has.

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:34.220
The power of all the gods…

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:35.430
I see!

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:44.190
Jupiter is preventing the light from reaching the moon…

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:47.240
That's the code you were reading at the festival?

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:52.410
Yeah. Jupiter is the power of all gods.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:54.120
It's about Zeus.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.000
What do you mean?

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:00.210
In other words, we have to get back the moon's light.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.250
If we break Zeus's ring…

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:05.760
the light will return to the two moons, to the two Himekas.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:06.670
So…

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:08.590
If we break the ring…

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:11.470
the two Himekas will be saved, right?

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:12.470
Yeah.

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:16.680
I won't let you.

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:18.730
The rings that will be broken…

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:20.770
are yours!

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:23.110
If we break Zeus's ring…

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.900
the two Himekas will be saved.

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:26.280
Let's go, Karin!

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.400
Yeah!

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:09.670
Those Who are Lost in Time's Labyrinth

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:08.170
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.170 --> 00:24:10.250
Those who are lost in time's labyrinth.

00:24:10.250 --> 00:24:12.420
Kazune-kun, Himeka-chan…

00:24:12.420 --> 00:24:14.340
To protect those important to me,…

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:16.470
I'll never give up!

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:19.220
I am God!
